OL,5,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FFrom Norwich Cathedral, with music
OL,7,     Fby Bairstow, Stanford and Harwood.
OL,8,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,9,     F4/5. Donald Macleod delves into a
OL,10,     Fperiod when Samuel Barber starts
OL,11,     Flooking to old compositions as
OL,12,     Finspiration for new ones.
OL,13,G1700 In Tune
OL,14,     FCellists Christopher Allan, Adrian
OL,15,     FBradbury, Ian Burdge, and Ben
OL,16,     FRogerson - Cellophonics - perform
OL,17,     Flive, and Trevor Herbert discusses
OL,18,     Fhis new book The Brass Band Story.
